        "text_Ly3M9L": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The construction industry is experiencing significant growth due to an uptick in government expenditures in large-scale infrastructure projects such as railways and highways and an increase in public-private partnerships for infrastructure development.</p><p>As a result, the demand for adhesive tapes has increased as they are valuable tools in the construction industry used to seal, bond, and fill gaps in construction applications.</p><p>Along with many other benefits, innovations in adhesive products allow building professionals to comply with new regulations requiring enhanced performance for building construction and cut construction costs by reducing installation and drying times.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
