        "text_iMrkTM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With over 25 years of experience, NADCO uses cutting-edge equipment and technology to deliver superior adhesive tapes to our clients in the construction industry.</p><p>We specialize in customizing adhesive tapes to fit specific applications and are committed to continuous improvement through research and development. If you can imagine it, NADCO® will make it stick.</p><p>Our commitment to quality is made evident by our numerous certifications, which include:</p><ul><li>UL-authorized label supplier</li><li>First Florida LEED Silver Certified manufacturer</li><li><a href=\"https://www.jasanz.org/\" target=\"_blank\">JAS-ANZ</a></li></ul><p><br/>NADCO is proud to offer fully customizable solutions and reliable product quality while maintaining reduced lead times and low costs. Our durable adhesive tapes are easy to install and are extremely versatile with enhanced service life cycles.</p><p>To learn more about our services,<a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Request a Quote\"> request</a> a quote or<a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\"> contact</a> us today.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
